{"symbol":"SUPERIRON","yahoo":"SUPERIRON.BO","bse":null,"isin":null,"sme":null,"name":"Super Iron Foundry Limited","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Metal Fabrication","website":"https://superironfoundry.com","about":"Super Iron Foundry Limited, together with its subsidiaries, manufactures and sells iron and steel castings for water pipe networks, railways, counterweights, and agriculture industries in India and internationally. The company offers municipal casting comprising manhole covers, gully gratings, and access covers; ductile iron pipe fittings; custom ductile iron vehicle components; agricultural castings rollers, such as crosskills and iron parts for machinery; railway castings, including rail chairs, base plates, fishplates, and brake shoes; cast iron counterweights for balancing machinery; and screw piles. It also provides electrical castings. The company also exports its products. The company was founded in 1977 and is based in Kolkata, India. Super Iron Foundry Limited is a subsidiary of ABI Trading Pvt. Ltd.","updated":"2026-10-01T12:13:56+00:00","quote":{"price":37.3,"prevClose":37.5,"marketCap":87.26,"high52":53.19,"low52":24.0,"pe":5.24,"bookValue":82.77,"dividendRate":0.0,"roe":9.15,"shares":2.3394,"insiders":77.2,"institutions":0.0},"prices":{"dates":["2025-03-19","2025-03-20","2025-03-21","2025-03-24","2025-03-25","2025-03-26","2025-03-27","2025-03-28","2025-04-01","2025-04-02","2025-04-03","2025-04-04","2025-04-07","2025-04-08","2025-04-09","2025-04-11","2025-04-15","2025-04-16","2025-04-17","2025-04-21","2025-04-22","2025-04-23","2025-04-24","2025-04-25","2025-04-28","2025-04-29","2025-04-30","2025-05-02","2025-05-05","2025-05-06","2025-05-07","2025-05-08","2025-05-09","2025-05-12","2025-05-13","2025-05-14","2025-05-15","2025-05-16","2025-05-19","2025-05-20","2025-05-21","2025-05-22","2025-05-23","2025-05-26","2025-05-27","2025-05-28","2025-05-29","2025-05-30","2025-06-02","2025-06-03","2025-06-04","2025-06-05","2025-06-06","2025-06-09","2025